---
description: Keep the Expo mobile app a thin copy of the web map — no extra abstractions
globs: mobile_app/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# mobile_app

- v1 is login/register + the map. Do not add Mushroompedia, account, pricing, or plan gating.
- Copy the web map: same Mapbox style URLs, same GCS tile URLs, same `predictions` source-layer, same `species_prediction` color stops.
- Auth is in-app email OTP via `@clerk/expo` `useSignIn` / `useSignUp` (`emailCode.sendCode` / `verifications.sendEmailCode`). No password. Google SSO is allowed. No hosted Account Portal.
- If Mapbox shows nothing, fix token, style, source-layer, or zoom. Do not add fallback tiles or swallow errors.
- No Zustand, no `services/` folder, no shared package with `frontend/` until a second screen needs it.
- Duplicate mushroom JSON under `mobile_app/data/mushrooms`. Keep tile URLs in those files.
- Style with NativeWind using the forest palette: `#0A0E0C`, `#1B3022`, `#2D5F3F`, `#4A7C5D`, `#9CA89F`, `#F5F5F0`.
